WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.769
- Basically all it takes
to silence the majority

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.839 align:start position:0%
is a very loud, very aggressive
and intransigent minority.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.575 align:start size:97% position:3%
It can re-normalize an
entire institution by using,

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.877 align:start size:97% position:3%
by getting maybe 20% of
people inside an institution

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.113 align:start size:84% position:16%
to be very loud
and very solidified

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.515 align:start size:97% position:3%
and repeating the same thing
over and over and over.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.283
Which of course is what
the left is very good at.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.752 align:start size:88% position:13%
And you can see this
happen in your own life.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:97% position:3%
Like the example that's used
by Nassim Nicholas Taleb

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.958
is the example of you have a
family of four and the daughter

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:26.426
decides one day
she's vegetarian.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.129 align:start size:97% position:3%
So she comes home, she says
to mom, "I'm vegetarian

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:30.764
and I want a vegetarian meal."

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:32.799
And mom says, "Okay well I
can either make two meals,

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:34.868
one that's vegetarian for
her and one that's good

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.970
for everybody else, or
I can make a vegetarian

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.204
meal for everyone."

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.472 align:start size:88% position:13%
And so mom decides,
I'm making a vegetarian

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.974
meal for everyone.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:42.175 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well daughter has now
re-normalized the family.

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.443
The family is now vegetarian

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:44.711
because daughter
was intransigent.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.246
And you can expand
that outward, right?

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:47.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
The whole family now wants
to go to a block party,

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.249 align:start size:84% position:16%
they say to the person
at the block party,

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:51.284
"We need a vegetarian meal for
us because of our daughter,"

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.219
and the person says, "Okay,
do I really wanna, you know,

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.054
go out and buy two meals.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.622
I'll buy one meal."

00:00:55.622 --> 00:00:56.890
Now everybody's vegetarian
'cause of this one person.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.124
You can see that sort
of stuff happening

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.692
inside our institutions.

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.594
It requires intransigence
and it requires solidity.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:03.096
You can't move on the position,

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.597 align:start size:84% position:16%
you have to be
really intransigent

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.599
and the imposition that
you're making on somebody

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.935
has to be just minor enough
that they don't really fight

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:09.869
back against you.

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.472
(gentle music)

