for a reason.

00:23:13.925 --> 00:23:15.794 align:start size:84% position:16%
You moved to Florida
for a reason.

00:23:15.794 --> 00:23:17.696 align:start size:84% position:16%
Like, let the
fragmentation occur,

00:23:17.696 --> 00:23:19.598
