00:23:19.598 --> 00:23:21.566
And then I would say,
perhaps we just need

00:23:21.566 --> 00:23:24.069 align:start size:88% position:13%
a complete fragmentation
of the economy too.

00:23:24.069 --> 00:23:25.937
And we'll just, I mean, you
