that route but it's like,

00:23:33.545 --> 00:23:35.213 align:start size:84% position:16%
I don't see an
alternative in a way.

00:23:35.213 --> 00:23:36.448
- Yeah.

00:23:36.448 --> 00:23:37.549
I mean, it may be
an eventuality.

00:23:37.549 --> 00:23:38.750 align:start size:84% position:16%
So it's not
something I'd prefer,

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:39.985
I've said this over and
