00:24:42.080 --> 00:24:43.715
on Texas or Florida.

00:24:43.715 --> 00:24:45.150
- Yeah.

00:24:45.150 --> 00:24:46.384 align:start size:97% position:3%
So listen, I wanna go through
quickly each, you know,

00:24:46.384 --> 00:24:47.819
a little bit on each chapter.

00:24:47.819 --> 00:24:50.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I wanna jump to
