00:24:59.331 --> 00:25:02.834
What was in HB3 and in Texas,
what they're doing in Georgia.

00:25:02.834 --> 00:25:04.769
And there's nothing racist.

00:25:04.769 --> 00:25:07.706 align:start size:88% position:13%
In many cases, it allows
