00:25:13.345 --> 00:25:15.247 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean everything in these
bills, as far as I can see it,

00:25:15.247 --> 00:25:17.916
is to make sure there
is more transparency.

00:25:17.916 --> 00:25:21.019
But the reason I liken
this to chapter seven,

00:25:21.019 --> 00:25:24.289
the fake news, is that
the media will not cover

00:25:24.289 --> 00:25:25.790
