and brown people from voting.

00:25:30.195 --> 00:25:33.231
And no matter how many
times we expose them,

00:25:33.231 --> 00:25:35.433 align:start size:88% position:13%
Jake Tapper is not going
to talk about that.

00:25:35.433 --> 00:25:36.835
Brian Stelter is not
gonna talk about it.

00:25:36.835 --> 00:25:38.937 align:start size:88% position:13%
The New York Times is
not gonna talk about it.

00:25:38.937 --> 00:25:40.438
So what do we do?

00:25:40.438 --> 00:25:43.308 align:start position:0%
- I mean, the only answer there
is that people in the state

00:25:43.308 --> 00:25:44.543 align:start size:84% position:16%
seem to know this,
which is why they keep

00:25:44.543 --> 00:25:46.011
electing Republicans.

00:25:46.011 --> 00:25:48.380 align:start position:0%
I mean, like these election
