00:25:48.380 --> 00:25:50.815 align:start size:97% position:3%
in the states that they
are currently being passed.

00:25:50.815 --> 00:25:52.284
And you're right.

00:25:52.284 --> 00:25:54.119
I mean, the media are at
this point just open agents

00:25:54.119 --> 00:25:56.621 align:start position:0%
of the Democratic party, pushing
the Democratic party line.

00:25:56.621 --> 00:25:59.457 align:start position:0%
Whether it's all misinformation
ought to be banned online,

00:25:59.457 --> 00:26:01.593
or whether it's all
these voter fraud,

00:26:01.593 --> 00:26:04.396
all these voter fraud bills
are really about suppressing

00:26:04.396 --> 00:26:05.664
the black vote.

00:26:05.664 --> 00:26:08.600
Let me put it this way,
the amount of, the lie,

00:26:08.600 --> 00:26:10.635
they keep saying it's the big
lie that voter fraud decided

00:26:10.635 --> 00:26:12.137
the last election.

00:26:12.137 --> 00:26:13.772
All right, if that's a big
