00:26:13.772 --> 00:26:15.574 align:start position:0%
that voter suppression is
widespread in the United States.

00:26:15.574 --> 00:26:18.009 align:start size:84% position:16%
That is just an
overt, ridiculous lie.

00:26:18.009 --> 00:26:20.579 align:start position:0%
There is no evidence to suggest
that black people are being

00:26:20.579 --> 00:26:24.049 align:start position:0%
suppressed on a systematic
level and prevented from voting.

00:26:24.049 --> 00:26:25.283
It's just not true.

00:26:25.283 --> 00:26:26.785 align:start size:84% position:16%
There is no evidence
of it whatsoever.

00:26:26.785 --> 00:26:28.420
And yet that's the basis
