00:34:27.698 --> 00:34:28.533
- Yeah.

00:34:28.533 --> 00:34:29.367
It's nuts.

00:34:29.367 --> 00:34:30.835
All right, chapter two,

00:34:30.835 --> 00:34:33.771 align:start size:97% position:3%
"How the Authoritarian Left
Re-normalized America."

00:34:33.771 --> 00:34:35.706 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, we're
watching everything

00:34:35.706 --> 00:34:37.642 align:start size:84% position:16%
being sort of
attacked right now.

00:34:37.642 --> 00:34:39.143
- Yeah, I think that
the key to understand

00:34:39.143 --> 00:34:41.879
how this went from sort
of small institutions

00:34:41.879 --> 00:34:44.549
to the nation broadly, I
think the Obama presidency

00:34:44.549 --> 00:34:45.783
was transformational.

00:34:45.783 --> 00:34:47.285
And I think the reason
the Obama presidency

00:34:47.285 --> 00:34:49.687 align:start size:97% position:3%
was transformational is when
Barack Obama ran in 2008,

00:34:49.687 --> 00:34:51.722
he ran on the basis that he
was going to be a unifying

00:34:51.722 --> 00:34:53.091
force in America.

00:34:53.091 --> 00:34:54.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's gonna bring
together black and white.

00:34:54.559 --> 00:34:55.359
There was no black, no white,
there were just Americans.

00:34:55.359 --> 00:34:56.260
No red, no blue, right?

00:34:56.260 --> 00:34:57.228
The whole shtick.

00:34:57.228 --> 00:34:59.530
And then after 2008, he governed

00:34:59.530 --> 00:35:01.099
