00:35:08.473 --> 00:35:11.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
And by 2012, he's no
longer running as unifier.

00:35:11.109 --> 00:35:12.844
He's decided, "You know what?

00:35:12.844 --> 00:35:15.012
I can unify a couple
