00:35:16.547 --> 00:35:18.950
One strand is the very heavy
government run progressivism

00:35:18.950 --> 00:35:20.685
that begins in the
early 20th century.

00:35:20.685 --> 00:35:21.619
And I can do that.

00:35:21.619 --> 00:35:22.587
Right, that's my policy."

00:35:22.587 --> 00:35:23.888
And then the other strand

00:35:23.888 --> 00:35:28.226
is this kind of critical
race theory, far left,

00:35:28.226 --> 00:35:29.460
