00:35:29.460 --> 00:35:30.695 align:start size:84% position:16%
And these two ideas
have been in conflict.

00:35:30.695 --> 00:35:32.163
Right?

00:35:32.163 --> 00:35:33.364
The radical left had always
said, "Burn it all down,

00:35:33.364 --> 00:35:34.599 align:start size:88% position:13%
we don't trust LBJ,
he's part of the system,

00:35:34.599 --> 00:35:35.867
