00:35:35.867 --> 00:35:37.335
And then you had sort
of the moderate left,

00:35:37.335 --> 00:35:38.970 align:start size:97% position:3%
which was, "Let's spend a
crap load of money, we can fix

00:35:38.970 --> 00:35:40.471
all problems with
the government."

00:35:40.471 --> 00:35:42.807
Now those two things appear
to be sort of in conflict

00:35:42.807 --> 00:35:45.610
with one another but Barack
Obama brought them together.

00:35:45.610 --> 00:35:48.146
Because what he said is,
"Yes, I can do anything

00:35:48.146 --> 00:35:50.915
with government, right, but
I'm actually tearing down

00:35:50.915 --> 00:35:52.517
the system from the inside."

00:35:52.517 --> 00:35:54.685
Right, I took over the
system, I'm one of you,

00:35:54.685 --> 00:35:55.920
