00:36:19.443 --> 00:36:21.445 align:start size:97% position:3%
that he makes the shift on gay
marriage in order to appeal

00:36:21.445 --> 00:36:23.481
to the LGBT coalition.

00:36:23.481 --> 00:36:26.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he starts making,
you know, overt plays,

00:36:26.384 --> 00:36:29.020 align:start size:88% position:13%
for example, with regard
