00:36:29.020 --> 00:36:30.888 align:start size:94% position:6%
some overt plays with
regard to Asian-Americans

00:36:30.888 --> 00:36:32.123
on certain issues.

00:36:32.123 --> 00:36:34.091
And it was, he was one
of the first candidates

00:36:34.091 --> 00:36:35.793 align:start size:84% position:16%
to have like specific
outreach groups

00:36:35.793 --> 00:36:38.262 align:start size:88% position:13%
for every intersectional
coalition member.

00:36:38.262 --> 00:36:40.631 align:start position:0%
And then the idea was, and
then we will all side together,

00:36:40.631 --> 00:36:42.333
in the same way you see
this on college campuses,

00:36:42.333 --> 00:36:44.535
to fight the institutions
and the powers that be.

00:36:44.535 --> 00:36:46.704
Now the irony was he
was the institution.

00:36:46.704 --> 00:36:47.939
He was the powers that be.

00:36:47.939 --> 00:36:50.107
But this is why he kept
saying, we need to gut

00:36:50.107 --> 00:36:52.243
