00:36:55.279 --> 00:36:56.814
We have to build back better.

00:36:56.814 --> 00:36:59.083
It's not enough for us to go
back to the thriving economy

00:36:59.083 --> 00:37:01.018
that we had a couple of, you
know, a year and a half ago.

00:37:01.018 --> 00:37:02.486 align:start size:81% position:19%
No, we have to
build back better.

00:37:02.486 --> 00:37:04.789 align:start size:97% position:3%
We are going to fundamentally,
re-change the institutions

00:37:04.789 --> 00:37:07.692 align:start size:97% position:3%
by combining the progressive
power of the government

00:37:07.692 --> 00:37:10.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
with this revolutionary
idea that the institutions

00:37:10.661 --> 00:37:12.964
themselves are bad and
need to be uprooted.

00:37:12.964 --> 00:37:15.266
- Right, and then we
hear like my governor,

00:37:15.266 --> 00:37:17.368 align:start size:84% position:16%
at least for now,
Gavin Newsom saying,

00:37:17.368 --> 00:37:20.071
this is the opportunity
