00:37:58.809 --> 00:38:00.278
For the left, it doesn't matter.

00:38:00.278 --> 00:38:01.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
Right, the most
transformative presidents

00:38:01.712 --> 00:38:03.848 align:start position:0%
are the ones who may have
